{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c91673d1-a819-42dd-bc50-e22fc9ab14c8","agentId":"a3bb137d2ec9bec69","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Work on GitHub issue #13 using the hq-work skill (.claude/skills/hq-work/SKILL.md, AGENTS.md). The human explicitly assigned it. Only the CODE side: in scope files apps/mobile/app.config.ts and apps/mobile/README.md (HealthKit entitlement, UIBackgroundModes audio, EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL notes, steps for `bunx expo run:ios --device`, Watch signing result left as TODO for the human). Note existing HealthKit plugin config in app.config.ts already has NSHealthShareUsageDescription, NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription:false, background:false; keep it. The on-device Verify steps need the human's Mac/iPhone: do NOT claim them done; say so in the PR. Claim with ./hq claim 13 --agent claude; if the claim is refused because #8 is open, stop and report the exact message, do not force it. Run ./hq check, open PR with ./hq pr, Entire trail steps per AGENTS.md (if trail linking 409s, report, don't retry). Never read .env files or print secrets. Do NOT merge. Final report under 100 words."},"uuid":"4c9b6223-8dea-4e0c-8b33-1f9724c074ef","timestamp":"2026-11-14T19:43:26.338Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/Users/nick/conductor/repos/durhack-proj/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3bb137d2ec9bec69","sessionId":"736d853a-59a1-497e-9c09-03efc1099979","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
